# Tests for syntax.sem: every invariant of `groupRows`, the word readers, and the
# rejection readers is verified below. Rows are compared as a listing, one line
# per row, each word as `line:column text|`, so one string shows every word's
# place and spelling.

rowsTest is test
rowsTest purpose "Lines become rows of words, dotted names one word and a minus sign part of its integer"
rowsTest verifies groupRows rowsOfWords
rowsTest verifies groupRows joinsDottedNames
rowsTest verifies groupRows negativeIntegers
rowsTest verifies listRows oneLinePerRow
rowsTest typeParameter none
rowsTest input none
rowsTest output none
rowsTest outputOwnedBy none
rowsTest raises none
rowsTest effect none
rowsTest uses none
rowsTest memoryHeap true
rowsTest async false
rowsTest maxRecursion none
rowsTest label begin loopKind none
rowsTest label begin within none
rowsTest label lexed loopKind none
rowsTest label lexed within none
rowsTest label grouped loopKind none
rowsTest label grouped within none
rowsTest label compare loopKind none
rowsTest label compare within none
rowsTest label refused loopKind none
rowsTest label refused within none
rowsTest let source String "main is operation # a comment, with \"quotes\"\n\nmain let total Int64 -12 immutable\nx invokes console.writeLine\n" immutable
rowsTest let expected String "1:1 main|1:6 is|1:9 operation|\n3:1 main|3:6 let|3:10 total|3:16 Int64|3:22 -12|3:26 immutable|\n4:1 x|4:3 invokes|4:11 console.writeLine|\n" immutable
rowsTest let refusedText String "the front end refused the source or a step failed" immutable
rowsTest at begin do lex
rowsTest at begin branch ifError lex goto refused else goto lexed
rowsTest at lexed do newWords
rowsTest at lexed do newRows
rowsTest at lexed do group
rowsTest at lexed branch ifError group goto refused else goto grouped
rowsTest at grouped do listIt
rowsTest at grouped branch ifError listIt goto refused else goto compare
rowsTest at compare do expectListing
rowsTest at compare return ok none
rowsTest at refused do failRefused
rowsTest at refused return ok none

store is region
store in rowsTest
store strategy arena
store maxBytes 65536
store released atReturn

lex is call
lex in rowsTest
lex invokes lexer.tokenize
lex argument source String source lend
lex argument resultRegion Region store lend
lex result tokens lexer.Tokens
lex ownedBy store
lex cleanedBy none
lex borrows none
lex catch lexError lexer.LexError
lex suppresses none

